<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kerr-McGee cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kerr-McGee cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said on Wednesday it had reduced its rating for Kerr-McGee Corp to market outperform from its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were off 1/2 to 69-1/4 in mid-morning trade.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
